      <p class="adt-body flex-1 leading-relaxed">
        <span data-id="pg012_n0007">Ishin festat e fundvitit.</span>
        <span data-id="pg012_n0008">Moti i ftoht&#xeb; i fundvitit nxiti f&#xeb;mij&#xeb;t e shkoll&#xeb;s q&#xeb; t&#xeb; mendonin p&#xeb;r f&#xeb;mij&#xeb;t n&#xeb; nevoj&#xeb;.</span>
