        <span data-id="pg012_n0010">Secili f&#xeb;mij&#xeb;, sipas mund&#xeb;sive, do t&#xeb; sillte di&#xe7;ka q&#xeb; do t&apos;u dhurohej f&#xeb;mij&#xeb;ve n&#xeb; nevoj&#xeb;.</span>
        <span data-id="pg012_n0011">Mund t&#xeb; ishin rroba q&#xeb; f&#xeb;mij&#xeb;t nuk i p&#xeb;rdornin m&#xeb;, mund t&#xeb; ishte ndonj&#xeb; shall apo doreza, ndonj&#xeb; fletore apo mjet tjet&#xeb;r shkollor, ndonj&#xeb; produkt higjienik apo &#xe7;far&#xeb;do tjet&#xeb;r q&#xeb; do t&apos;i leht&#xeb;sonte dit&#xeb;t e ftohta t&#xeb; dimrit.</span>
        <span data-id="pg012_n0012">T&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; kishin sjell&#xeb; dhurata t&#xeb; bukura.</span>
